B.BF=new A.b7(B.aas,["EMI = P\xb7i\xb7(1+i)\u207f/((1+i)\u207f\u22121). Early EMIs are mostly interest; prepaying early saves the most. Check the Loan Prepayment tool.","SIP invests a fixed amount monthly, averaging purchase price across market cycles (rupee-cost averaging). Starting early beats investing more later because of compounding: value grows \u221d (1+r)\u207f.","GST is applied on the taxable value. To remove GST from an inclusive price: base = gross \xf7 (1 + rate). Intra-state sales split into CGST + SGST.",'BMI = weight/height\xb2. It is a screening tool, not a diagnosis \u2014 athletes can score "overweight" with low body fat. Pair it with the Navy body-fat tool.',"CAGR smooths growth into a single annual rate: (end/start)^(1/years) \u2212 1. It hides volatility \u2014 two investments with the same CAGR can have very different journeys.","India FY 2025-26: the new regime rebates full tax up to \u20b912L taxable income (\u20b912.75L for salaried after standard deduction). Old regime wins only with large deductions (HRA + 80C + home loan).","Concrete dry volume = 1.54 \xd7 wet volume (bulking of sand). M20 means 1:1.5:3 mix (cement:sand:aggregate) with 20 MPa characteristic strength.","Probability = favorable/total outcomes. For small samples, use the Binomial tool; for rare-event rates, the Poisson tool."],t.l)
